# EvidenceLens rules

Read and follow the repository root AGENTS.md. It is the shared source of truth across coding agents.
Read docs/engineering-standards.md for standards relevant to the current change.
Load only matching skills from .agents/skills; see docs/agent-tooling.md for their scope.
Prefer framework capabilities over custom boilerplate. Do not generate speculative services or abstractions.
For example, use the selected validation library's schema handling rather than duplicating request-validation infrastructure.
